          "docs": "Retrieve Media Check headlines results by the article IDs.\n\n**Example HTTP request**\n\n```\n    {\n      \"articleIds\":[\n        \"articleID1\",\n        \"articleID2\",\n        \"articleID3\"\n      ]\n    }\n```\n"
